From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Eden PS4 <eden-ps4@localhost>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 15:59:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] null renderer: small software draws queued and rasterized
 together on the rasterizing threads

---
 .../renderer_null/null_rasterizer.cpp         |  48 +-
 .../renderer_null/null_rasterizer.h           |   4 +
 .../renderer_null/renderer_null.cpp           |   1 +
 .../renderer_null/software_draw.cpp           | 914 ++++++++++--------
 src/video_core/renderer_null/software_draw.h  |   8 +
 5 files changed, 584 insertions(+), 391 deletions(-)

